> 
> win98 reports it as:
> ESS Solo-1 DOS Emulation
> ESS SOLO-1 PCI Audiodrive
> it use the same defaults as a SB compatible.
> 
> I tried to run sndconfig using all the cards and was unsucessful... what
> do you suggest?
